# Tetra visual identity

When designing or coding any Tetra surface, apply `tetra-visual` (global + `.cursor/skills/tetra-visual`; keep those two files identical). In this repo also read `brand/GUIDE.md` and `tetra-vite-ui` (or `tetra-pdf` for print).

- Void `#050705`. Radius 0. Jost. Green `#22c55e` primary. Violet and orange are glows only.
- Mark is Tetrahedron G (`brand/geometry/tetrahedron-g.svg`).
- Default build is Vite. Import `brand/tokens.css` and `brand/chrome.css`.
- One top chrome: bar smokes out (width + opacity); top-left triangle appears only when the bar is fully gone.
- Bottom-right dock triangle opens the sliding footer. Glass only on chrome.
- Buttons: gold line pauses; no parked corner triangle. Sweep with transform, not animated gradient stops.
